ORIGIN
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package was extracted from `@ariada-org/brand` (Apache-2.0, internal
monorepo) on 2026-05-16. Only the CSS design tokens were extracted; the
brand logo SVG files were intentionally left in the private monorepo because
they are trademark-restricted and would create downstream brand-confusion if
mistakenly re-distributed.

License change: Apache-2.0 → MIT. Both licences are permissive; MIT was
chosen to maximise downstream adoption (design-system tooling and theme
ecosystems converge on MIT) and because the tokens carry no patent risk
that the Apache-2.0 patent grant could have leaked.

